msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"I guess the Tojo Clan ended up on top after their rumble with the Omi "
"Alliance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"I never liked those Osaka yakuza, to tell you the truth. Can't say I'm not "
"relieved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Yeah, but if the Tojo Clan doesn't pick a successor for the fifth chairman "
"soon, Kamurocho's gonna be in some deep shit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"I heard the territories of all of the yakuza families got mixed up in the "
"confusion, so now they're fighting each other for who gets what."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Yeah, but is there really anyone in the Tojo Clan who can take over as the "
"sixth chairman?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"What about Daigo-san, the son of the Dojima Family patriarch? I'll bet he's "
"got what it takes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Daigo-san? The dude's so young, though. I don't think the older guys are "
"gonna be willin' to stand by while he barks orders at 'em. Things are gonna "
"be tough."
msgstr ""

